Subject: list: rows keyed by item, groups by category

What: List renders groups keyed by category and each group's rows diffed by item
reference, so a filter change re-renders only the rows that enter or leave;
`data-active`/`data-selected` read createSelector instead of a comparison per row.
Split into list.tsx (state and keys), list-groups.tsx (rows), list-scroll.ts
(keeping the active row in view) and list-search.tsx (the search field).
Why: measured with Solid's computation counter while typing into each list:
file palette "markdown" 18,458 -> 7,198 computations; command palette "settings"
29,996 -> 9,026; model picker "gpt" 75,069 -> 1,892.

